WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:05.779
Over the last few years fans have watched
the Justice League and the wider DCEU come

00:00:05.780 --> 00:00:10.520
together, but that's only the beginning of
Warner's plans for Worlds of DC domination.

00:00:10.660 --> 00:00:13.500
So just what is there to look forward to in
the years to come?

00:00:13.540 --> 00:00:17.600
Here are a few of the most exciting DC movies
slated for release.

00:00:17.980 --> 00:00:23.800
In July 2018, Warner Brothers announced that
Joaquin Phoenix had signed on to star in Joker,

00:00:24.020 --> 00:00:28.890
a standalone feature exploring the origins
of Gotham's Clown Prince of Crime from director

00:00:28.890 --> 00:00:29.980
Todd Phillips.

00:00:30.150 --> 00:00:33.960
The internet took a moment to scratch its
collective head, then voiced a fair degree

00:00:33.960 --> 00:00:39.050
of skepticism particularly after a short teaser
surfaced showing Phoenix looking pretty much

00:00:39.050 --> 00:00:43.140
like he normally does, albeit wearing some
Pagliacci style clown makeup.

00:00:43.290 --> 00:00:47.720
Phillips, a director known mostly for his
comedy work, promised "a gritty character

00:00:47.720 --> 00:00:51.890
study" and a "cautionary tale," which only
seemed to add to the skepticism.

00:00:51.890 --> 00:00:56.850
Then, in April 2019, the first teaser trailer
dropped and the skeptics fell silent probably

00:00:56.850 --> 00:00:58.520
because their jaws were on the floor.

00:00:58.620 --> 00:01:03.160
Joker looks to be a dark film anchored by
a ferocious performance from Phoenix.

00:01:03.170 --> 00:01:07.700
It's also the first of Warner Brothers and
DC's promised attempts to tell filmmaker-driven

00:01:07.700 --> 00:01:10.979
stories outside Extended Universe continuity.

00:01:10.979 --> 00:01:14.740
While speculation has run rampant that this
will connect to Matt Reeves' forthcoming The

00:01:14.740 --> 00:01:20.160
Batman, Phillips has insisted that his Joker
is strictly a one-shot, and a unique one at

00:01:20.160 --> 00:01:20.660
that.

00:01:20.660 --> 00:01:22.860
As Phillips recently told The Hollywood Reporter:

00:01:22.860 --> 00:01:26.540
"When the marketing department asked me the
other day to describe the movie, I said 'I

00:01:26.540 --> 00:01:27.040
can't.'

00:01:27.240 --> 00:01:32.159
They said at least tell us the genre, and
I thought about it for a minute and said,

00:01:32.160 --> 00:01:33.160
'It's a tragedy.'"

00:01:33.440 --> 00:01:38.440
Suicide Squad may have been a bit of a mess,
but it at least featured a solid take on fan

00:01:38.440 --> 00:01:39.580
favorite Harley Quinn.

00:01:39.829 --> 00:01:45.020
There are multiple projects on tap for the
character, but first up is Birds of Prey (And

00:01:45.029 --> 00:01:50.259
the Fantabulous Emancipation of One Harley
Quinn), which has been described as an "R-rated

00:01:50.259 --> 00:01:55.920
girl gang film" in which Harley teams up with
Huntress and Black Canary to face off against

00:01:55.920 --> 00:01:59.500
Black Mask, who is chasing after a young Cassandra
Cain.

00:01:59.680 --> 00:02:04.560
It sounds like pretty dark stuff, but Margot
Robbie has explained that the film's mouthful

00:02:04.569 --> 00:02:08.959
of a title was meant to reflect the fact that
the it'll be a bit more lighthearted than

00:02:08.960 --> 00:02:09.760
it might appear.

00:02:09.960 --> 00:02:16.099
"Like, Birds of Prey makes it sound so serious,
and that kinda, you know is like Harley adding

00:02:16.100 --> 00:02:17.540
‘Hey,I'm in this, too.’"

00:02:17.720 --> 00:02:22.060
Fans will be quick to note that, in the comics,
Cain eventually takes up the mantle of Batgirl,

00:02:22.060 --> 00:02:26.080
though it remains to be seen if her film incarnation
will follow suit.

00:02:26.620 --> 00:02:32.360
2017's Wonder Woman was the first DCEU effort
to be widely embraced by fans and critics

00:02:32.360 --> 00:02:38.549
alike, and its sequel, Wonder Woman 1984,
will see Diana taking on new challenges during

00:02:38.549 --> 00:02:39.680
the era of yuppies.

00:02:39.680 --> 00:02:45.040
Originally scheduled for a November 2019 release,
the flick was pushed back to summer 2020 to

00:02:45.040 --> 00:02:50.540
avoid competition with Joker and placing it
in the same release slot where the first film

00:02:50.540 --> 00:02:52.280
found blockbuster success.

00:02:52.520 --> 00:02:57.380
The sequel has cast Kristen Wiig as the hero's
frequent nemesis Cheetah, as well as Pedro

00:02:57.390 --> 00:03:02.500
Pascal in an as-yet unconfirmed role which
some insiders have claimed will be Maxwell

00:03:02.500 --> 00:03:05.420
Lord, who in the comics is a villainous telepath.

00:03:05.500 --> 00:03:10.740
Interestingly, Chris Pine is also set to return
as Steve Trevor, despite his character meeting

00:03:10.740 --> 00:03:12.540
his end in the first film.

00:03:12.720 --> 00:03:16.680
Patty Jenkins will return to the director's
chair, working from a screenplay she co-wrote

00:03:16.680 --> 00:03:22.660
with comics legend Geoff Johns and Dave Callaham,
who will also be scripting Shang-Chi for Marvel

00:03:22.660 --> 00:03:23.160
Studios.

00:03:23.620 --> 00:03:28.260
While it's always seemed inevitable that DC
would field a solo movie starring the Flash,

00:03:28.269 --> 00:03:30.489
the project has endured a troubled road.

00:03:30.489 --> 00:03:35.860
The character was introduced in 2016's Batman
v Superman with Ezra Miller in the role, but

00:03:36.280 --> 00:03:41.340
since then, the Scarlet Speedster's standalone
film has seen a revolving door of behind-the-camera

00:03:41.340 --> 00:03:41.840
talent.

00:03:41.840 --> 00:03:47.460
In early 2018, Warner Bros. landed Spider-Man:
Homecoming screenwriters John Francis Daley

00:03:47.469 --> 00:03:52.219
and Jonathan Goldstein to direct the picture,
which by that point had already been announced

00:03:52.219 --> 00:03:55.079
as an adaptation of the Flashpoint storyline.

00:03:55.079 --> 00:03:59.370
With Miller's WB contract expiring in May,
the star took it upon himself to craft his

00:03:59.370 --> 00:04:04.269
own version of the Flashpoint script along
with legendary comics scribe Grant Morrison

00:04:04.269 --> 00:04:06.030
in a bid to hang on to the role.

00:04:06.030 --> 00:04:10.579
It's been reported that Warner's brass liked
Miller's dark, gritty script, but unfortunately

00:04:10.580 --> 00:04:15.269
not enough to reverse course on the lighter,
funnier version that Daley and Goldstein are

00:04:15.269 --> 00:04:16.380
intent on delivering.

00:04:16.380 --> 00:04:20.980
This means that, despite his best efforts,
Miller's time as Barry Allen is almost certainly

00:04:20.980 --> 00:04:21.480
done.

00:04:21.540 --> 00:04:26.460
Warner Bros. is likely to act fast in recasting
the part, as Flashpoint is still thought to

00:04:26.460 --> 00:04:28.360
be on track for a 2020 release.

00:04:29.020 --> 00:04:34.120
The fate of standalone outing The Batman has
been up in the air ever since the relative

00:04:34.120 --> 00:04:36.520
failure of Justice League at the box office.

00:04:36.780 --> 00:04:41.480
One misses the days where one’s greatest
concerns were exploding wind-up penguins."

00:04:41.680 --> 00:04:47.040
Ben Affleck was initially on board to reprise
the role and direct, but after he relinquished

00:04:47.040 --> 00:04:50.910
the director's chair to Matt Reeves, rumors
started swirling that he was done with the

00:04:50.910 --> 00:04:51.910
cape and cowl.

00:04:51.910 --> 00:04:56.360
This has now been confirmed, as Reeves has
gone public with a few details about his film

00:04:56.360 --> 00:04:59.060
and Affleck took to Twitter to wish the director
well.

00:04:59.260 --> 00:05:03.660
Although the story will focus on Bruce Wayne's
early years as a costumed crime-fighter, Reeves

00:05:03.660 --> 00:05:08.100
has gone on record saying that it won't be
an adaptation of Frank Miller's Year One comics

00:05:08.100 --> 00:05:08.600
storyline.

00:05:08.660 --> 00:05:13.460
He's also confirmed that the film will indeed
share a connection to the rest of the DCEU,

00:05:13.460 --> 00:05:16.100
which may or may not have something to do
with Joker..

00:05:16.300 --> 00:05:19.820
Production on The Batman is slated to begin
in November 2019.

00:05:20.360 --> 00:05:26.000
Marvel fans rejoiced when it was announced
in March 2019 that James Gunn had been reinstated

00:05:26.000 --> 00:05:30.200
by Disney as director of Guardians of the
Galaxy Vol. 3.

00:05:30.460 --> 00:05:34.380
Unfortunately, they're gonna have to wait
for him to finish up one other project first:

00:05:34.380 --> 00:05:39.520
The Suicide Squad, which he was hired to write
and direct during his brief exile from Marvel.

00:05:39.700 --> 00:05:44.270
With the project firmly in Gunn's capable
hands, this new Squad is shaping up to be

00:05:44.270 --> 00:05:49.310
not so much a sequel as a soft reboot of the
story, so, we'll be seeing some new faces

00:05:49.310 --> 00:05:51.360
when the film drops in summer 2021.

00:05:51.580 --> 00:05:55.460
"Well that's it so we’re some sorta suicide
squad."

00:05:55.860 --> 00:06:00.380
Foremost among these is Idris Elba, who may
be taking over the role of Deadshot from Will

00:06:00.380 --> 00:06:00.880
Smith.

00:06:01.120 --> 00:06:06.060
Gunn is said to be drawing heavily from the
the antihero team's Deadshot-centric '80s

00:06:06.060 --> 00:06:11.020
comics run, with the mercenary serving as
a sort of mentor figure to the assembled baddies.

00:06:11.120 --> 00:06:15.700
Among the other characters rumored to be appearing
are Ratcatcher, a former exterminator who

00:06:15.710 --> 00:06:21.030
commands armies of rodents; King Shark, a
humanoid shark; Polka Dot Man, who can use

00:06:21.030 --> 00:06:26.840
his wardrobe's spotty adornments as weapons;
and Peacemaker, a vigilante so dedicated to

00:06:26.840 --> 00:06:28.520
peace that he'll kill.

00:06:28.700 --> 00:06:30.740
Sounds like a James Gunn joint through-and-through.

00:06:31.460 --> 00:06:36.780
Jason Momoa's appearance as Aquaman in 2017's
Justice League was received well even though

00:06:36.780 --> 00:06:40.030
the movie itself underperformed at the box
office.

00:06:40.030 --> 00:06:45.560
But then a funny thing happened: James Wan's
Aquaman, again featuring Momoa in the role,

00:06:45.560 --> 00:06:50.500
became a smash hit, raking in over a billion
dollars worldwide and becoming the highest-grossing

00:06:50.500 --> 00:06:52.300
film in the DCEU.

00:06:52.520 --> 00:06:56.690
It didn't take long for Warner Bros. to determine
that they had a hot property on their hands,

00:06:56.690 --> 00:07:00.480
and in February 2019, it was confirmed that
a sequel is in the works.

00:07:00.840 --> 00:07:05.710
The first film's co-screenwriter, David Leslie
Johnson-McGoldrick, is already hard at work

00:07:05.710 --> 00:07:10.060
on the script, and Wan will be returning as
a producer, although it's unclear if he will

00:07:10.060 --> 00:07:10.560
direct.

00:07:10.560 --> 00:07:15.620
As for Momoa, nothing is set in stone but
given his intensely charismatic performance

00:07:15.620 --> 00:07:19.750
and wholehearted commitment to the role, it's
unlikely that the project would be moving

00:07:19.750 --> 00:07:21.380
forward if he were not on board.

00:07:21.610 --> 00:07:25.660
If nothing else, Warner Brothers is definitely
taking their time to make sure they get this

00:07:25.660 --> 00:07:31.280
one extra-right: Aquaman 2 splashes down in
theaters on December 16, 2022.

00:07:32.020 --> 00:07:36.720
Back in 2014, Dwayne Johnson was handed the
role of Black Adam during the first round

00:07:36.730 --> 00:07:41.590
of casting for Shazam!, but his involvement
was scrapped when the filmmakers decided on

00:07:41.590 --> 00:07:43.540
a more lighthearted approach to that movie.

00:07:43.540 --> 00:07:48.220
As producer Hiram Garcia explained to Collider,
it was also determined that Black Adam was

00:07:48.220 --> 00:07:50.820
compelling enough to support a feature of
his own.

00:07:50.820 --> 00:07:51.640
Garcia said:

00:07:51.900 --> 00:07:56.500
"We were just realizing that both characters
are so special that we didn't want to compromise

00:07:56.500 --> 00:07:59.100
either of them by cramming them both into
the same movie.

00:07:59.300 --> 00:08:03.040
We're actually very deep into a script on
it right now, which is coming along really

00:08:03.040 --> 00:08:03.540
well."

00:08:03.540 --> 00:08:08.380
In an Instagram post in April 2019, Dwayne
Johnson confirmed that due in large part to

00:08:08.380 --> 00:08:13.440
the success of Shazam! production on the flick
is expected to finally begin in 2020.

00:08:14.040 --> 00:08:18.380
Warner Bros. hit a bit of a roadblock when
it comes to meeting its scheduled July 2020

00:08:18.380 --> 00:08:20.140
release date for Green Lantern Corps.

00:08:20.260 --> 00:08:23.780
The film was set to feature a script by David
Goyer and Justin Rhodes.

00:08:23.780 --> 00:08:28.270
The script they'd prepared featured Hal Jordan
and Jon Stewart as the primary Lanterns and

00:08:28.270 --> 00:08:33.620
had been described as "Lethal Weapon in space,"
which admittedly does sound pretty awesome.

00:08:33.620 --> 00:08:35.120
That script has since been scrapped.

00:08:35.460 --> 00:08:39.520
Acclaimed comics scribe Geoff Johns, who made
his name writing the world of Green Lantern

00:08:39.530 --> 00:08:43.420
for several years, is now attached to rewrite
the script from page one.

00:08:43.420 --> 00:08:48.250
He says it will be very much akin to what
he recently did with DC's Rebirth initiative

00:08:48.250 --> 00:08:49.250
and that it's

00:08:49.250 --> 00:08:52.760
"...going to celebrate the mythology, and
reinvent it in a different way."

00:08:53.240 --> 00:08:58.060
Justice League may have been a resounding
disappointment, but with the DCEU having finally

00:08:58.070 --> 00:09:02.900
found its footing with the critical and financial
success of Wonder Woman and Aquaman, that

00:09:02.900 --> 00:09:07.260
doesn't necessarily mean that another go-round
isn't in the cards.

00:09:07.440 --> 00:09:11.480
Indeed, the sequel could be seen as an opportunity
for Warner to make good on the things they

00:09:11.480 --> 00:09:16.450
got wrong the first time, but the big question
is, “will the movie shift the focus to the

00:09:16.450 --> 00:09:22.010
more successful DCEU movie characters?”
- you know, instead of the one’s whose mother

00:09:22.010 --> 00:09:23.360
share the same name.

00:09:23.500 --> 00:09:25.360
"Why did you say that name!?!"

00:09:25.460 --> 00:09:29.940
Some have speculated that Aquaman director
James Wan would be a perfect fit to take on

00:09:29.950 --> 00:09:34.540
a Justice League sequel, especially now that
Zack Snyder is officially out of the picture.

00:09:34.540 --> 00:09:39.820
For his part, Aquaman star Jason Momoa loves
the idea of a sequel, and has theorized that

00:09:39.820 --> 00:09:42.380
Black Manta could assemble the Legion of Doom.

00:09:42.560 --> 00:09:44.400
He told the Toronto Sun:

00:09:44.500 --> 00:09:48.240
"Seeing all the bad guys together and seeing
us come in would be awesome.

00:09:48.360 --> 00:09:52.460
I'd definitely like to come riding in on a
tidal wave to whoop some ass."

00:09:56.460 --> 00:09:57.480
“Ride ain't over yet."

00:09:58.120 --> 00:09:58.620
"My man!"

00:09:59.900 --> 00:10:04.490
Perhaps no piece of superhero news has rocked
the movie world quite like the rumors that

00:10:04.490 --> 00:10:07.720
actor Henry Cavill will be stepping down as
Superman.

00:10:08.120 --> 00:10:13.450
In September 2018, news leaked that negotiations
between Cavill and Warner Brothers had broken

00:10:13.450 --> 00:10:18.270
down over a cameo in Shazam!, leading to the
actor removing himself from the role.

00:10:18.270 --> 00:10:22.630
Since then, Warner Brothers and Cavill's own
rep have insisted that Cavill is still employed,

00:10:22.630 --> 00:10:27.130
though the star himself has played it coy,
with one bizarre Instagram video being his

00:10:27.130 --> 00:10:28.380
only public comment.

00:10:28.510 --> 00:10:32.640
While a script for Man of Steel 2 is confirmed
to be in the works, there's no telling how

00:10:32.640 --> 00:10:35.780
this potentially massive shakeup will affect
the film's progress.

00:10:35.920 --> 00:10:40.580
After all, finding the perfect Superman is
no small feat, and it's hard to imagine the

00:10:40.580 --> 00:10:44.300
studio moving forward with this one until
they land a replacement for Cavill.

00:10:44.720 --> 00:10:47.080
